{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1111701-c20-and-w20-play-by-post-looking-for-players","id":1111701,"title":"C20 and W20 Play-by-post Looking for Players","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-05T10:25:31-07:00","id":1111701,"title":"C20 and W20 Play-by-post Looking for Players","content":"A couple of us launched an off-site play-by-post forum a couple months back for a community we've been playing with for a few years, and I think we're at the point with it that we're stable enough to start advertising it. <br /> <br /> <br /> We're using a jcink forum that currently hosts on-going games for C20, V20, and W20. Each game is seperate, not cross genre, and run by a different storyteller, and we thought we'd extend an invitation to anyone that's interested in looking at it. <br /> <br /> <br /> All games are open for new player characters, but V20 is the most popular with about 20 players or so, so we're specifically looking for players interested in Changeling: The Dreaming and Werewolf: The Apocalypse. <br /> <br /> <br /> A url to the forum is below. Feel free to look around, and if you have any questions, you can also register and PM a Storyteller, or drop into our public discord chat. Thanks for your time.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://aworldindarkness.jcink.net/index.php?act=idx\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qg2clAl.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://aworldindarkness.jcink.net/index.php?act=idx\" target=\"_blank\"> A World in Darkness </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://aworldindarkness.jcink.net/index.php?act=idx\" target=\"_blank\"> http://aworldindarkness.jcink.net/index.php?act=idx </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> World of Darkness Play-by-post </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i43.photobucket.com/albums/e384/GrottyGilgamesh/3812c9a0-1510-4235-a3d4-1993f1a47b4b_zpsd6723580.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4266-mousegbn","name":"MouseGBN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4266_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-07T18:00:43-07:00","id":1138466,"title":"","content":"Hi everyone, just popping in with a quick update.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat vampire game launched in August with 10 or so players, Mage had to be put on hold because the person that asked to run it had some stuff come up. We still have a little less than 10 players that would like to play it, myself very enthusiastically included.. because mage... but until we find another person to run it, it has to wait. <br /> <br /> Changeling and Werewolf are still looking for more players. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i43.photobucket.com/albums/e384/GrottyGilgamesh/3812c9a0-1510-4235-a3d4-1993f1a47b4b_zpsd6723580.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4266-mousegbn","name":"MouseGBN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4266_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-27T14:45:52-08:00","id":1163101,"title":"","content":"Another small update: Werewolf is sitting at about 8 or 9 players now and is in a good place. There is still room if anyone wants to try it, but Changeling could still use a lot more.<br /> <br /> Also! ALSO ALSO! <br /> <br /> I finally found a storyteller for Mage: The Ascension! She's a sweetheart, and plans to have the game up and running by the beginning of December! I really like her pitch for the game, and out the gate there should be something like 6 or so players, including myself. Come get it while it's hot!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i43.photobucket.com/albums/e384/GrottyGilgamesh/3812c9a0-1510-4235-a3d4-1993f1a47b4b_zpsd6723580.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4266-mousegbn","name":"MouseGBN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4266_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}